{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not offload transient condition initialization.** This helper now offloads, but `WaitForConditionOperation.start()` still uses it only to normalize `initialState`; that envelope is never checkpointed. Each first execution can therefore create an orphan external payload and fail on unnecessary storage access before the first check. Use `normalizeResult` for the initial state and test the offload count and payload contexts.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pp3-O","finding_digest":"433a99f9f87e165fae051b4cd183ec42feda0cf2957539c5436102106a19c9d7","finding_id":"arf_v1_im5jt6pypylf7lqfdngnda7mil","finding_key":"sdk/operation/waitforconditionoperation::start::transient-initial-state-offload","identity_key":"sdk/operation/waitforconditionoperation::start::transient-initial-state-offload","line":165,"observation_digest":"b90b7d1f89354593503202f7285bb0bb17927b54dfb100a809a46072754c23f6","observation_id":"aro_v1_xefx2h4jgvczgubsal3sqw5qxm","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/SerializableDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:58:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vnej7biqklapuyocr3sx64w35k","reviewed_base_sha":"4c6822cc220948aebb437a95ebe6acc0cb1c2175","reviewed_head_sha":"a52a63745d2f0ef2031adef2aeb872568f0fafbf","reviewer":"codex","start_line":157,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_4346d3swnrdau2hwltoukxaixw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:58:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
